        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/e68b1a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-02-05T22:46:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When I first saw the new cards for most of the heros I was really excited.&nbsp; Many of them seemed to address play issues that some (if not all) had with the heros.&nbsp; Bunker had something to do with extra mode cards, AZ and Wraith got some direct damage.&nbsp; Tachyon in amazingly good in both addressing an issue she had and also helping the team.&nbsp; Then I saw Tempest and thought \"huh, I haven't ever had problems with him needing cards, but I guess more draw is always good.\"&nbsp; Still I when I play Tempest I rarely use that power, it seems more like a power that Expat would LOVE.&nbsp; It would help with card draw and bad draw issue and since she doen't have many one-shots that do damage she would basically pass a damage turn to get some juice.</p>",
